  "title": "Boneless Chicken Breast with Tomatoes, Coconut Milk, and Chickpeas in the Slow Cooker",
  "description": "A very easy slow cooker dish with boneless chicken breast, tomatoes, coconut milk, chickpeas, and onion that requires barely any prep time.",
